WEBVTT

00:10:02.125 --> 00:10:03.726
they'll edit this part out --

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:05.708
(Laughter)

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.643
a ripened experience of love,

00:10:12.667 --> 00:10:14.143
compassion,

00:10:14.167 --> 00:10:16.476
intimacy based on a truth

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:20.184
that you are sharing from your mind's eye

00:10:20.208 --> 00:10:24.476
and the heart that we all can touch,

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.226
tactilely feel,

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:30.684
have maybe potentially a mushy experience